<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65529" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγᾰλό-ψῡχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high-souled, generous</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1123b2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργετικὸς καὶ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					22.21.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγαλοψυχία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.20.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				31.28.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				36
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότερος</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, φαίνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.235
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Eux.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἔχειν πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.140
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήσασθαι τοῖς πράγμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.8.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				194.11
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεγκεῖν συμφοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>CG</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>romantic, Quixotic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				2.140c
			</span></i>.</div>
